{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In an increasingly oppressive world, a magpie feeds her only remaining child in a world of lackluster sightseers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take their vision and feed your son.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gameplay Summary:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience a blend of fast-paced arcade action and narrative storytelling. Switch between reflex-driven eye-stealing combat and unsettling visual novel segments. Navigate a decaying cityscape, collect &quot;eyes&quot; before bringing them back to your nest, and progress through increasingly hostile environments shaped by humanity\u2019s ignorance and excess.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Eye-catching, palatable arcade action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Black and white pixelated visuals with a modernised retro Atari aesthetic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Visual novel segments filled with detailed drawings and animations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two-leggeds designed with close accordance to the stupidity of their real-life counterparts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A city inspired by real world habitable landfills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dystopian advertisements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Excessive amounts of corpses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dark, edgy humor to make nasty sights easier to swallow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Vomit-inducing audio.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An overabundance of eyes, ripe for picking.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>YOUR VENGEANCE WILL BE